{1}{Allow me to introduce myself, I am Gilbert Bates, as I am sure you may have surmised. I'd like to extend my thanks to you, sir, for putting an end to the difficulties at my factory. I've been informed that there is a matter you wish to discuss?}{Allow me to introduce myself, I am Gilbert Bates, as I am sure you may have surmised. I'd like to extend my thanks to you, madam, for putting an end to the difficulties at my factory. I've been informed that there is a matter you wish to discuss?}{}{}{}{}
