{60}{Yes. I am ... familiar with dwarves and their customs. Tell me, was there anything distinctive about his fellow?}{Yes. I am ... familiar with dwarves and their customs. Tell me, was there anything distinctive about his fellow?}{}{}{}{}
{61}{He had a scar over his left eye.}{}{5}{}{70}{}
{70}{By Alberich! I knew it in my heart - that was no gnome. It was Stennar Rock Cutter. [He is visibly shaken by this realization.]}{By Alberich! I knew it in my heart - that was no gnome. It was Stennar Rock Cutter. [He is visibly shaken by this realization.]}{}{}{}{ru2016}
