{780}{I am unsure as to whether I should employ you as my emissary at all. I do not like you nor the feelings you would engender in people as a representative of the Bates' name.}{I am unsure as to whether I should employ you as my emissary any longer. I do not like you or the feelings you would engender in people as a representative of the Bates' name.}{}{}{}{}
