{1035}{ I have never actually claimed that I did. It was just people's assumption. I have invented any number of devices based off its principals, but I did not invent the first one.}{ I have never actually claimed that I did. It was just people's assumption. I have invented any number of devices based off its principals, but I did not invent the first one.}{}{}{}{}
