{1053}{Who let this sheep in here?}{Who let this sheep in here?}{}{}{}{}
{1054}{Thank you for all your help. I wish to be left alone to ruminate on my life.}{Thank you for all your help. I wish to be left alone to ruminate on my life.}{}{}{}{}
{1055}{Appleby is a disturbed hack. We have known each other since we were in short pants, when we were actually friends. As I began to patent my inventions, though, he became increasingly hostile.}{Appleby is a disturbed hack. We have known each other since we were in short pants, when we were actually friends. As I began to patent my inventions, though, he became increasingly hostile.}{}{}{}{}
{1056}{Why is that?}{}{5}{}{1058}{}
{1058}{He always was going on about how he was going to be a fabulously wealthy industrialist, but he's not very intelligent. At first it was sad, but he has become dangerously unhinged in recent years.}{He always was going on about how he was going to be a fabulously wealthy industrialist, but he's not very intelligent. At first it was sad, but he has become dangerously unhinged in recent years.}{}{}{}{}
